      "updated": 1791738840761,
      "created": 1791733062762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design notification system",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design notification system",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xYo7by-bNXUVKjK-dzTBr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1144.239657596424,
      "y": 3928.6140093648337,
      "width": 1091.278357130923,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b57",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 199131451,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 828380501,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791738661691,
      "created": 1791738645921,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a notification system that lets other services send messages to users over push, email, and\nSMS. Services call an API to trigger a notification, such as an OTP, an order update, or a\npromotional campaign. The system should respect each user's preferences, render the message from a\ntemplate per channel, retry failed deliveries, and track the delivery status. Urgent messages like\nOTPs must go out quickly and never wait behind bulk promos. The system should survive bursts from\nlarge campaigns and recover when a third-party provider goes down, without losing messages or\nsending duplicates.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a notification system that lets other services send messages to users over push, email, and SMS. Services call an API to trigger a notification, such as an OTP, an order update, or a promotional campaign. The system should respect each user's preferences, render the message from a template per channel, retry failed deliveries, and track the delivery status. Urgent messages like OTPs must go out quickly and never wait behind bulk promos. The system should survive bursts from large campaigns and recover when a third-party provider goes down, without losing messages or sending duplicates.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0Gzxq6oGkE324_A8YOyEf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1143.2539534364105,
      "y": 4137.092421772555,
      "width": 1076.2196127182906,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b58",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 455148635,
      "version": 110,
      "versionNonce": 1366962741,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791738909811,
      "created": 1791738773332,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "scale \n\nAbout 10M notifications/day (≈115/s average, ≈1K/s peak), with campaign bursts up to ≈10K/s for\naround 10 minutes. Roughly 60% push, 30% email, 10% SMS, and about 10% of traffic is high\npriority (OTPs) that must be delivered within about 5 seconds.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "scale \n\nAbout 10M notifications/day (≈115/s average, ≈1K/s peak), with campaign bursts up to ≈10K/s for around 10 minutes. Roughly 60% push, 30% email, 10% SMS, and about 10% of traffic is high priority (OTPs) that must be delivered within about 5 seconds.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Peb2e_9vjj5LbgbUZI9FM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1141.775383095644,
      "y": 4317.477997705722,
      "width": 1001.6139615482998,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1380057685,
      "version": 314,
      "versionNonce": 979141909,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791739579530,
      "created": 1791739047935,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. send notification \n2. multiple notification channels(Push, Email, SMS)\n3. user can able to set notification preferences\n4. Different templates per channel\n5. Tract the delivery status ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. send notification \n2. multiple notification channels(Push, Email, SMS)\n3. user can able to set notification preferences\n4. Different templates per channel\n5. Tract the delivery status ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "t6q4plXQBU6pBJJh5yZPD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1140.6468051402408,
      "y": 4516.735001323784,
      "width": 1020.3639234751133,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5BV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1695639829,
      "version": 965,
      "versionNonce": 1495256123,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791740666781,
      "created": 1791739488346,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n1. System must handle 10M notifications/day\n2. System should be highly available 99.9%\n3. Highly available >> consistency | user can tolerate eventual consistency for\nnotifications\n4. User should get response within ~200ms for p99 and message delivery handled async| otp\nmust be delivered under 5sec",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n1. System must handle 10M notifications/day\n2. System should be highly available 99.9%\n3. Highly available >> consistency | user can tolerate eventual consistency for notifications\n4. User should get response within ~200ms for p99 and message delivery handled async| otp must be delivered under 5sec",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5EUFN8os-_FLw9aWm0plY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1137.3396720733458,
      "y": 4746.756240147452,
      "width": 965.1352389147886,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 996308539,
      "version": 353,
      "versionNonce": 847924507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791741051615,
      "created": 1791740681023,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Back of Envelope estimations \n\n- 10M notification/day 10^7/10^5 = ~ 100 qps and at peak x3 = 300qps\n- storage 1 rec = 500byte 10M * 500byte = 5GB/day\n- throughput ~50kb/s\n- bandwidth 50kbps",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Back of Envelope estimations \n\n- 10M notification/day 10^7/10^5 = ~ 100 qps and at peak x3 = 300qps\n- storage 1 rec = 500byte 10M * 500byte = 5GB/day\n- throughput ~50kb/s\n- bandwidth 50kbps",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "O8K51xikh48rqrDiP_jCS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1137.3396720733458,
      "y": 4927.634676621074,
      "width": 981.4135960457114,
      "height": 925,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1418291099,
      "version": 1181,
      "versionNonce": 61640091,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791743521153,
      "created": 1791741090842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entities\n- users + clients\n- notifications\n- user_preferences\n- notification_templates\n- delivery_status\n\nApis\n//send notification -> Idempotent | async notification processing | returns 202, 401\nPOST /notification/send {\n    template_id,\n    variables,\n    header -> sender_id,\n    receiver_ids,\n    channels,\n    category,\n    priority\n}\n\n// Create user notification preferences\nPOST /user/preferences {\n   user_id,\n   channel,\n   category\n}\n\n// Create Template\nPOST /notifications/template {\n    title,\n    subtitle,\n    body,\n    ?img,\n    channel\n}\n\n// Check notification Delivery status\nGET /notifications/{id}?channel={} -> List<DeliveryStatus> ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities\n- users + clients\n- notifications\n- user_preferences\n- notification_templates\n- delivery_status\n\nApis\n//send notification -> Idempotent | async notification processing | returns 202, 401\nPOST /notification/send {\n    template_id,\n    variables,\n    header -> sender_id,\n    receiver_ids,\n    channels,\n    category,\n    priority\n}\n\n// Create user notification preferences\nPOST /user/preferences {\n   user_id,\n   channel,\n   category\n}\n\n// Create Template\nPOST /notifications/template {\n    title,\n    subtitle,\n    body,\n    ?img,\n    channel\n}\n\n// Check notification Delivery status\nGET /notifications/{id}?channel={} -> List<DeliveryStatus> ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
